-- an explicit value after the profile change is checked against the new constraints
-- and so is a reset
-- a rejected statement leaves the profile unapplied
-- an assignment before the profile change is not checked against the new constraints
7
-- the constraints the profile installed are in force afterwards
10	1
-- assigning the value the profile installed is a no-op and stays allowed
-- an unconstrained setting after the profile change still applies
1234
